// TODO Neos.Neos-20251005080230 Line 62: You very likely need to rewrite "VARIABLE.label" to "Neos.Node.label(VARIABLE)". We did not auto-apply this migration because we cannot be sure whether the variable is a Node.
// TODO Neos.Neos-20251005080230 Line 66: You very likely need to rewrite "VARIABLE.label" to "Neos.Node.label(VARIABLE)". We did not auto-apply this migration because we cannot be sure whether the variable is a Node.
